8. Termination and Consequences of Violation

Any permission granted under this License terminates immediately and
automatically upon violation of any term of this License.

Upon termination, the violator shall immediately cease all use of the
Original Materials and delete all copies, derivatives, extracts,
mirrors, archives, stored versions, generated derivatives, transformed
versions, compiled versions, bundled versions, datasets, model inputs,
model outputs that substantially reproduce protected material, indexes,
embeddings, and other reproductions under the violator's possession or
control, except to the extent retention is strictly compelled by
applicable law.

Termination does not limit any rights or remedies available to Kento
Konishi under copyright law, contract law, unfair competition law,
trademark law, database law, trade secret law, platform terms, or any
other applicable law.

